<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank board meeting ends, no changes.</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank board meeting ends, no changes.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, ended a board meeting on Thursday morning with no interest rate changes announced.</p>
<p>The Riksbank has currently set its key interst rate, the repo, at 4.10 percent. Its other two key rates, the deposit and lending rates, stand at 3.75 percent and 5.25 percent, respectively.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
